        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rice seed, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rice seed, at regional storehouse
Inventory refers to 1kg rice seed, at regional storehouse. ;
UUID: c290e391-b0c5-3d0a-9636-06cb041a5bf3
The seed produced at the farm is transported to the processing centre, treated (pre-cleaning, cleaning, eventually drying, chemical dressing and bag filling), stored and afterwards transported to the regional storage centre. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: conventional production typical for the country
Time period:  
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data come from wheat inventory and own estimation for transports. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c290e391-b0c5-3d0a-9636-06cb041a5bf3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
